    volume: 52
    issue: "D1"
    start: D1333
    end: D1346
    year: 2024
    doi: 10.1093/nar/gkad1005
  - type: article
    title: "A corpus of GA4GH phenopackets: Case-level phenotyping for genomic diagnostics and discovery"
    authors:
